{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/cutscenes.gif?t=1743976491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atrion Project is a fast-paced, intense 2D action game blending hack-and-slash, platforming, and die &amp; retry mechanics, all set in a dark and mysterious sci-fi universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Atrion, a cybernetic hybrid with no memory, stranded on an unknown planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: recover the scattered parts of your ship, face deadly enemies, and uncover the secret of who you are...<br>You won\u2019t be alone, a few precious allies will stand by your side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">     <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/explore.gif?t=1743976491\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a fluid and intuitive combat system, built for fast reaction and smooth control, no unnecessary complexity, just precision and impact.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock unique abilities and take down memorable bosses in a progression designed to test your reflexes and sense of timing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">     <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/fight.gif?t=1743976491\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade Atrion, unlock a variety of powers, and adapt your playstyle to overcome increasingly intense challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/powers.gif?t=1743976491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The challenge is real but always fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every victory brings you one step closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">     <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/die.gif?t=1743976491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FOR FANS OF:</strong><br><i>Dead Cells, ScourgeBringer, Katana Zero, Axiom Verge, Furi</i><br><i>...and stylized, mysterious, hostile sci-fi worlds.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You will fall. Learn. Retry. Better be ready.</strong><br><strong>Add it to your wishlist now.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2451700?t=1743976491","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/3dd79ef75ecf661d42613708a3642bba81f4d2ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743976491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/041ac2c1b106f904f345cbdfc8c04ff707d3bf51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743976491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/041ac2c1b106f904f345cbdfc8c04ff707d3bf51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743976491","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3075600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/cutscenes.gif?t=1743976491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atrion Project is a fast-paced, intense 2D action game blending hack-and-slash, platforming, and die &amp; retry mechanics, all set in a dark and mysterious sci-fi universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Atrion, a cybernetic hybrid with no memory, stranded on an unknown planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: recover the scattered parts of your ship, face dea